      "paperId": "be7d9511c23c5b7050be92741a40170a797572e0",
      "title": "The Conflict of Pursuing Peace in an Unjust World: A Comparative Study of Monotheistic Religions",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Farhan Achmad Fajari",
